WEBVTT

00:09.143 --> 00:10.578
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.611 --> 00:12.480
Kids:
AYE AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是啊是，队长！

00:12.513 --> 00:14.048
I CAN'T HEAR YOU!
我听不到你说话！

00:14.082 --> 00:15.583
AYE AYE, CAPTAIN!
是啊是，队长！

00:15.616 --> 00:18.319
* OH...
* 哦...

00:18.352 --> 00:20.721
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.754 --> 00:22.723
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.756 --> 00:24.492
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:24.525 --> 00:26.160
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.194 --> 00:28.796
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH *
*如果航海废话
成为您所希望的*

00:28.829 --> 00:30.298
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.331 --> 00:32.766
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑腾*

00:32.800 --> 00:34.702
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:34.735 --> 00:36.637
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.670 --> 00:38.706
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
* 海绵宝宝

00:38.739 --> 00:40.674
* SPONGEBOB
SQUAREPANTS *
* 海绵宝宝
方裤 *

00:40.708 --> 00:44.545
* SPONGEBOB... SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝...方裤！

00:44.578 --> 00:46.714
( Captain laughs )
（队长笑）

00:46.747 --> 00:49.150
( plays flute tune )
（吹奏长笛曲调）

00:49.183 --> 00:53.487
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
