美国教育部

00:53.521 --> 00:55.789
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:01.395 --> 01:03.631
MERMAIDMAN.
美人鱼。

01:03.664 --> 01:05.599
FLEET AND FORCEFUL.
快速而有力。

01:05.633 --> 01:08.136
WITH ABILITY TO
ASSEMBLE AND CHARGE
有能力
组装和充电

01:08.169 --> 01:10.238
THE CREATURES OF THE DEEP.
深海生物。

01:10.271 --> 01:13.174
BY THE POWER OF NEPTUNE.
借助海王星的力量。

01:13.207 --> 01:15.876
MERMAIDMAN, WITH HIS
YOUNG ASSOCIATE BARNACLEBOY
美人鱼，和他的
年轻的同事藤壶男孩

01:15.909 --> 01:19.213
FIGHTS FOR ALL CREATURES
THAT LIVE IN THE SEA.
为所有生物而战
生活在海里的。

01:19.247 --> 01:21.749
AGAINST THE FORCES OF EVIL.
对抗邪恶势力。

01:22.316 --> 01:24.318
OH, NO!
哦，不！

01:24.352 --> 01:27.621
THE RAGING WHIRLPOOL.
汹涌的漩涡。

01:27.655 --> 01:33.327
MERMAIDMAN--
CHAMPION OF THE DEEP.
美人鱼--
深渊冠军。

01:36.930 --> 01:38.132
Together:
YEAH!
一起：
是啊！

01:38.166 --> 01:39.700
Spongebob:
CHAMPION OF THE DEEP.
海绵宝宝：
深渊冠军。

01:39.733 --> 01:40.901
Together:
YIPPEE!
一起：
耶皮！

01:40.934 --> 01:42.570
COME ON, BARNACLEBOY,
THERE'S EVIL AFOOT.
来吧，藤壶男孩，
邪恶正在发生。

01:42.603 --> 01:44.738
LEEPIN' LAMPREYS,
MERMAIDMAN.
七鳃鳗，
美人鱼。

01:44.772 --> 01:47.508
I'M RIGHT BEHIND YOU.
我就在你身后。

01:55.416 --> 01:57.818
Spongebob:
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY
SPOT THEIR ARCH ENEMY--
海绵宝宝：
美人鱼与藤壶男孩
发现他们的宿敌——

01:57.851 --> 02:00.754
REFLECTO, UP TO NO GOOD.
反思，没有好处。

02:01.355 --> 02:03.257
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

02:03.291 --> 02:05.159
YOU KNOW
WHAT THIS MEANS.
你知道
这意味着什么。

02:05.193 --> 02:06.560
DOUGHNUTS.
甜甜圈。

02:06.594 --> 02:08.429
OOH.
哦。

02:09.497 --> 02:11.932
BY THE POWER OF NEPTUNE.
借助海王星的力量。

02:11.965 --> 02:15.236
Together:
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY,
UNITE!
一起：
美人鱼和藤壶男孩，
团结起来！

02:15.269 --> 02:18.739
CREATURES OF THE DEEP
ASSEMBLE.
深海生物
组装。

02:18.772 --> 02:25.246
( both grunting )
（两人都咕哝着）

02:25.279 --> 02:27.548
HARDER, BARNACLEBOY.
更努力一点，藤壶男孩。

02:27.581 --> 02:28.449
HERE THEY COME.
他们来了。

02:29.417 --> 02:32.420
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

02:32.453 --> 02:33.621
BLAST!
爆炸！

02:33.654 --> 02:34.822
REFLECTO HAS BECOME
TOO POWERFUL.
Reflecto 已成为
太强大了。

02:40.394 --> 02:41.762
WHAT THE...
什么...

02:41.795 --> 02:43.731
OH!
哦！

02:43.764 --> 02:45.799
IF REFLECTO
IS CUT OFF FROM SUNLIGHT,
中频反射
与阳光隔绝，

02:45.833 --> 02:46.900
HE BECOMES WEAK.
他变得虚弱。

02:46.934 --> 02:49.437
JUMPIN' JELLYFISH, MERMAIDMAN.
跳跃的水母，美人鱼。

02:49.470 --> 02:50.904
HE'S DESTROYING THE SHIELD!
他正在摧毁盾牌！

02:50.938 --> 02:53.274
( muttering )
（嘀咕）

02:53.307 --> 02:54.275
OH!
哦！

02:54.308 --> 02:55.976
QUICK, BARNACLEBOY.
快点，藤壶男孩。

02:56.009 --> 02:57.545
BACK TO THE SEACAVE.
回到海边。

02:57.578 --> 02:59.747
RIGHT, MERMAIDMAN.
对了，美人鱼。

02:59.780 --> 03:01.415
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

03:05.519 --> 03:08.656
SPONGEBOB, OPEN IT UP.
海绵宝宝，打开它。

03:08.689 --> 03:10.691
REFLECTO HAS FOUND
OUR SECRET LAB.
反射已发现
我们的秘密实验室。

03:10.724 --> 03:13.561
WHAT WOULD
THE REAL MERMAIDMAN DO?
什么会
真正的美人鱼吗？

03:13.594 --> 03:15.763
WHY DON'T YOU ASK HIM YOURSELF.
你为什么不亲自去问他呢？

03:15.796 --> 03:18.599
ELABORATE, YOU VILE FIEND.
详细点，你这个邪恶的家伙。

03:18.632 --> 03:21.469
HE AND BARNACLEBOY LIVE
IN THE RETIREMENT HOME
他和藤壶男孩现场直播
在养老院

03:21.502 --> 03:22.970
ON THE OTHER SIDE OF TOWN.
在城镇的另一边。

03:23.003 --> 03:23.971
HMM.
唔。

03:24.004 --> 03:25.739
THEY MUST BE WORKING UNDERCOVER.
他们一定是在卧底工作。

03:25.773 --> 03:29.743
YEAH, NOW PLEASE LEAVE ME ALONE.
是的，现在请别打扰我。

03:29.777 --> 03:33.981
Together:
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY,
REUNITE!
一起：
美人鱼和藤壶男孩，
团聚！

03:40.288 --> 03:41.355
EXCUSE ME.
打扰一下。

03:41.389 --> 03:43.724
I KNOW MERMAIDMAN
我认识美人鱼

03:43.757 --> 03:46.394
IS WORKING UNDERCOVER
ON AN IMPORTANT CASE
正在进行卧底工作
关于一个重要的案例

03:46.427 --> 03:47.528
BUT DO YOU THINK
WE COULD SEE HIM?
但你认为
我们能看到他吗？

03:47.561 --> 03:49.530
UNDERCOVER?
秘密？

03:49.563 --> 03:51.432
YEAH, WELL I'LL SEE
是的，我会看看

03:51.465 --> 03:52.633
IF THEY CAN TAKE TIME
FROM THEIR BUSY SCHEDULE
如果他们能花点时间
从他们繁忙的日程中

03:52.666 --> 03:55.436
TO SEE YOU.
来看你。

03:55.469 --> 03:57.571
( laughing excitedly )
（兴奋地笑）

03:58.872 --> 04:01.409
HERE THEY ARE.
他们在这里。

04:01.442 --> 04:02.543
RIGHT OVER THERE.
就在那里。

04:02.576 --> 04:04.678
( happily gasping )
（高兴地喘气）

04:04.712 --> 04:06.747
TRY NOT TO SURPRISE THEM.
尽量不要让他们感到惊讶。

04:06.780 --> 04:11.852
PATRICK,
CAN YOU BELIEVE IT?
帕特里克，
你能相信吗？

04:11.885 --> 04:14.955
MERMAIDMAN
AND BARNACLEBOY
IN THE FLESH.
美人鱼
和藤壶男孩
在肉体中。

04:20.794 --> 04:23.063
HEY, WHO ARE THOSE GUYS?
嘿，那些人是谁？

04:23.096 --> 04:25.599
ARE THEY HERE
TO FIX THE T.V.?
他们在吗
要修电视吗？

04:25.633 --> 04:28.736
( nervous chattering )
（紧张的喋喋不休）

04:28.769 --> 04:29.903
WHAT DO YOU WANT?
你想要什么？

04:29.937 --> 04:32.906
ARE YOU MERMAIDMAN
AND BARNACLEBOY?
你是美人鱼吗
还有藤壶男孩？

04:32.940 --> 04:36.410
WELL, WE USED TO BE,
BUT NOW WE'RE RETIRED.
嗯，我们曾经是，
但现在我们退休了。

04:36.444 --> 04:37.845
( gasping together )
（一起喘气）

04:37.878 --> 04:38.612
BUT YOU CAN'T RETIRE.
但你不能退休。

04:38.646 --> 04:40.581
THERE'S EVIL AFOOT.
邪恶正在发生。

04:40.614 --> 04:43.083
WHAT EVIL!
多么邪恶啊！

04:43.116 --> 04:46.387
EVIL!
邪恶的！

04:46.420 --> 04:47.755
OOH!
哦！

04:47.788 --> 04:53.761
BARNACLEBOY!
DON'T FORGET THERE'S EVIL.
藤壶男孩！
不要忘记还有邪恶。

04:53.794 --> 04:55.896
ALL I SAID IS
THERE'S EVIL AFOOT.
我所说的是
邪恶正在发生。

04:55.929 --> 04:57.598
EVIL!
邪恶的！

04:57.631 --> 05:00.368
EEE... EEE...
呃……呃……

05:00.401 --> 05:02.403
WOULD YOU PLEASE
STOP SAYING THAT.
请你
别再说了。

05:02.436 --> 05:03.637
EVIL.
邪恶的。

05:03.671 --> 05:06.006
EVIL, EVIL, EVIL, EVIL.
邪恶，邪恶，邪恶，邪恶。

05:06.039 --> 05:07.541
OH!
哦！

05:07.575 --> 05:10.611
DISGRACE!
耻辱！

05:13.647 --> 05:15.816
( door slams shut )
（门砰地关上）

05:15.849 --> 05:17.117
WOW!
哇！

05:17.150 --> 05:19.487
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY.
美人鱼和藤壶男孩。

05:19.520 --> 05:21.589
IT'S TOO BAD THEIR OLD.
可惜他们老了。

05:21.622 --> 05:23.591
WHAT DO YOU MEAN, PATRICK.
你是什​​么意思，帕特里克。

05:23.624 --> 05:25.125
OLD PEOPLE ARE THE GREATEST.
老人是最伟大的。

05:25.158 --> 05:27.395
THEY'RE FULL OF WISDOM
AND EXPERIENCE.
他们充满智慧
和经验。

05:28.095 --> 05:29.630
( ting )
（婷）

05:29.663 --> 05:32.533
THE WORLD NEEDS
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY.
世界需要
美人鱼和藤壶男孩。

05:32.566 --> 05:34.902
SOMEONE, SOMEWHERE
IS IN TROUBLE
某人，某处
遇到麻烦了

05:34.935 --> 05:35.903
AND I WON'T REST
我不会休息

05:35.936 --> 05:37.571
UNTIL MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY
直到美人鱼和藤壶男孩

05:37.605 --> 05:40.107
ARE OUT OF RETIREMENT.
已退休。

05:40.140 --> 05:42.510
( fireworks )
（ 烟花 ）

05:42.543 --> 05:43.010
OOH, PRETTY LIGHTS.
哦，漂亮的灯。

05:47.481 --> 05:51.051
TO THE MEATLOAF.
到肉饼。

05:53.521 --> 05:56.557
TO THE BROCCOLI.
西兰花。

05:58.726 --> 06:03.931
MAKE SURE YOU GIVE EXTRA
BROCCOLI TO MY YOUNG WARD.
确保你给予额外的
西兰花给我年轻的病房。

06:03.964 --> 06:07.401
THE BOY NEEDS HIS VITAMINS.
这个男孩需要维生素。

06:07.435 --> 06:10.604
HERE YOU GO, SON.
( snickering )
给你，儿子。
（窃笑）

06:10.638 --> 06:14.542
TO THE TABLE-- AWAY!
到桌子上——走开！

06:14.575 --> 06:16.544
CAREFUL, DON'T RUN.
小心，别跑。

06:16.577 --> 06:18.979
HEY, MERMAIDMAN.
嘿，美人鱼。

06:19.012 --> 06:22.750
HEY, HERE COMES
THE T.V. REPAIRMAN.
嘿，来了
电视修理工。

06:22.783 --> 06:23.851
WHAT DO YOU WANT FROM US?
您想从我们这里得到什么？

06:23.884 --> 06:25.519
HOLD ON.
坚持，稍等。

06:25.553 --> 06:26.420
JUST LET ME LOOK AT YOU.
让我看看你。

06:26.454 --> 06:28.456
STAY ALERT,
BARNACLEBOY.
保持警惕，
藤壶男孩。

06:28.489 --> 06:30.624
HE'S, HE'S UP
TO SOMETHING.
他，他起来了
为了某事。

06:30.658 --> 06:32.826
WOULD YOU STOP
CALLING ME BOY?
你会停下来吗
叫我男孩？

06:32.860 --> 06:35.429
DO YOU REMEMBER THE TIME
THE FOOD SUPPLY IN ATLANTIS
你还记得时间吗
亚特兰蒂斯的食品供应

06:35.463 --> 06:36.497
WAS RUNNING LOW?
电量不足了吗？

06:36.530 --> 06:38.766
SO YOU INVENTED A RAY GUN
所以你发明了射线枪

06:38.799 --> 06:40.568
THAT MADE THINGS
GROW SIX TIMES THEIR SIZE
创造事物
体型增大六倍

06:40.601 --> 06:42.470
TO SHOOT AT THE KELP GARDENS.
在海带花园拍摄。

06:42.503 --> 06:44.638
BUT THEN, THE EVIL MAN RAY
SWOOPS DOWN
但是，邪恶的雷人
俯冲而下

06:44.672 --> 06:45.906
AND SWIPES THE GUN AWAY
并把枪扫开

06:45.939 --> 06:46.640
AND SHOOTS ALL THE ALGAE.
并射杀所有藻类。

06:46.674 --> 06:50.444
( imitating ray gun )
（仿射线枪）

06:50.478 --> 06:51.679
AND HE GLOMS ONTO
THE UNDERSEA DOME
他对着
海底圆顶

06:51.712 --> 06:55.449
AND HE STARTS
SUCKING ON THE GLASS.
他开始了
吮吸玻璃。

06:55.483 --> 06:56.383
WHAT'S YOUR POINT, KID?
孩子，你的观点是什么？

06:56.416 --> 06:59.086
YOU GUYS ARE THE GREATEST HEROES
OF ALL TIME.
你们是最伟大的英雄
有史以来的。

06:59.119 --> 07:00.654
AND I THINK YOU
SHOULD COME OUT OF RETIREMENT.
我想你
应该退休了。

07:00.688 --> 07:01.722
LISTEN UP.
听着。

07:01.755 --> 07:04.057
I WANT
TO EAT MY MEATLOAF.
我想要
吃我的肉饼。

07:04.091 --> 07:05.959
IF YOU DON'T
GET OUT OF HERE
如果你不这样做
离开这里

07:05.993 --> 07:08.195
THEN BY THE POWER
INVESTED IN ME
然后靠力量
投资于我

07:08.228 --> 07:10.831
I NOW PRONOUNCE YOU
MAN AND WIFE.
我现在宣布你
男人和妻子。

07:10.864 --> 07:13.467
WHAT IS GOING ON IN HERE?
这里发生了什么事？

07:13.501 --> 07:16.003
YOU MAY KISS
THE BRIDE.
你可以接吻
新娘。

07:16.036 --> 07:20.908
( Wedding March playing )
（婚礼进行曲演奏）

07:20.941 --> 07:22.810
DID YOU REUNITE OUR HEROES?
你让我们的英雄重聚了吗？

07:22.843 --> 07:24.978
NO, BUT I'M MARRIED.
不，但我已经结婚了。

07:27.981 --> 07:32.586
UP, UP AND AWAY.
向上，向上，离开。

07:32.620 --> 07:35.756
UP, UP AND AWAY.
向上，向上，离开。

07:35.789 --> 07:37.558
( Southern accent: )
OH, MY.
（南方口音：）
哦，我的。

07:37.591 --> 07:40.227
THIS PURSE IS
SO BIG AND HEAVY.
这个钱包是
又大又重。

07:40.260 --> 07:43.230
HOLD IT RIGHT THERE, MA'AM.
保持住，女士。

07:43.263 --> 07:44.965
I'LL BE TAKING THAT.
我会接受的。

07:44.998 --> 07:46.534
OH!
哦！

07:46.567 --> 07:48.936
HELP! HELP! HELP!
帮助！帮助！帮助！

07:48.969 --> 07:50.604
IT'S WORKING.
它正在发挥作用。

07:50.638 --> 07:54.007
WHY ARE YOU HERE
TO RESCUE LITTLE OLD ME?
你为什么在这里
拯救小老我？

07:54.041 --> 07:55.042
PIPE DOWN!
管下来！

07:55.075 --> 07:56.810
YOU'RE GOING
TO WAKE MERMAIDMAN
你要去
唤醒美人鱼

07:56.844 --> 07:58.612
AND HE'S AWRY
WHEN HIS NAP
S DISTURBED.
他错了
当他小睡的时候
S 不安。

07:58.646 --> 08:01.915
EVER ALERT
时刻警惕

08:01.949 --> 08:04.552
MERMAIDMAN TRAINED HIMSELF
TO SLEEP WITH HIS EYE OPEN.
美人鱼自我训练
睁着眼睛睡觉。

08:04.585 --> 08:07.187
GET AWAY FROM HIM.
远离他。

08:07.220 --> 08:08.522
STOP SHOUTING!
别喊了！

08:08.556 --> 08:09.590
I'M NAPPING.
我正在小睡。

08:09.623 --> 08:12.593
IT'S NOT ME, YOU OLD COOT.
这不是我，你这个老笨蛋。

08:12.626 --> 08:14.962
YES, THAT'S ME.
是的，那就是我。

08:14.995 --> 08:15.796
I'M OVER HERE.
我在这儿。

08:15.829 --> 08:18.866
( bickering )
（争吵）

08:18.899 --> 08:20.300
EXCUSE ME.
打扰一下。

08:20.333 --> 08:21.134
MERMAIDMAN.
美人鱼。

08:21.168 --> 08:23.937
WHAT DO YOU WANT?
你想要什么？

08:23.971 --> 08:24.772
THIS BETTER BE GOOD.
这最好是好的。

08:24.805 --> 08:26.173
THIS WILL CHEER YOU UP.
这会让你高兴起来。

08:26.206 --> 08:28.241
WE'RE ALMOST DONE PAINTING
YOUR INVISIBLE BOAT MOBILE.
我们快要完成绘画了
您的隐形船移动设备。

08:28.275 --> 08:33.814
IT'S SUPPOSED
TO BE INVISIBLE!
应该是
隐形！

08:33.847 --> 08:35.783
THAT'S IT!
就是这样！

08:35.816 --> 08:38.552
WE GOT TO END
OUR LIFE OF LEISURE.
我们必须结束了
我们的休闲生活。

08:38.586 --> 08:40.187
IT'S TIME TO COME OUT OF
RETIREMENT.
是时候出来了
退休。

08:40.220 --> 08:41.655
THERE'S EVIL AFOOT!
邪恶正在发生！

08:41.689 --> 08:43.256
EVIL!
邪恶的！

08:43.290 --> 08:45.959
WHERE IS IT?
它在哪里？

08:45.993 --> 08:47.127
THERE IT IS.
就在那里。

08:48.929 --> 08:51.331
DO YOU KNOW WHAT THIS MEAN?
你知道这是什么意思吗？

08:51.364 --> 08:52.833
DOUGHNUTS.
甜甜圈。

08:52.866 --> 08:55.068
OH, BROTHER.
哦，兄弟。

08:56.336 --> 08:58.205
( music starts and fades out )
（音乐开始并淡出）

09:00.273 --> 09:02.776
( music starts and fades out )
（音乐开始并淡出）

09:02.810 --> 09:03.543
SAY THE OATH.
宣誓。

09:03.577 --> 09:06.980
MERMAIDMAN AND BARNACLEBOY,
UNITE!
美人鱼和藤壶男孩，
团结起来！

09:07.014 --> 09:09.817
( music starts again
and tune finishes )
（音乐再次响起
并调完）

09:09.850 --> 09:11.051
THROW A WATER BALL AT HIM.
向他扔一个水球。

09:11.084 --> 09:14.822
Together:
WATER BALLS! WATER BALLS!
一起：
水球！水球！

09:14.855 --> 09:16.624
YEAH!
是的！

09:16.657 --> 09:19.126
( laughing )
（笑）

09:19.159 --> 09:20.861
MUMBLING, MORAYS
咕哝，海鳗

09:20.894 --> 09:23.063
IT'S NOT WORKING, MERMAIDMAN.
它不起作用，美人鱼。

09:23.096 --> 09:28.301
HE'S ABSORBING IT
LIKE SOME KIND OF
EVIL SPONGE.
他正在吸收它
喜欢某种
邪恶的海绵。

09:28.335 --> 09:30.838
Together:
DOG PADDLE AWAY!
一起：
狗划走！

09:35.909 --> 09:39.780
IT'S THE RAGING WHIRLPOOL!
这是汹涌的漩涡！

09:39.813 --> 09:44.685
( Spongebob and Patrick
cheering )
（海绵宝宝和帕特里克
欢呼）

09:44.718 --> 09:46.954
YOU FIENDS.
你们这些恶魔。

09:46.987 --> 09:50.057
THEY'RE ACTUALLY ENJOYING IT!
他们真的很享受！

09:50.090 --> 09:53.226
( screaming in delight )
（高兴地尖叫）

09:53.260 --> 09:56.329
Together:
DO IT AGAIN! DO IT AGAIN!
一起：
再做一次！再做一次！

09:56.363 --> 09:57.765
NOW WHAT, MERMAIDMAN.
现在怎么办，美人鱼。

09:57.798 --> 09:59.299
WE NEED HELP.
我们需要帮助。

09:59.332 --> 10:01.168
Together:
SEA CREATURES, UNITE.
一起：
海洋生物，团结起来。

10:08.008 --> 10:10.277
HUH! WHAT!
哈！什么！

10:10.310 --> 10:21.955
( all mumbling and chattering )
（全是咕哝和喋喋不休）

10:21.989 --> 10:24.357
HMM, THE CREATURES
OF THE DEEP
嗯，生物
深渊之

10:24.391 --> 10:25.893
SEEMED TO HAVE LOST
SOME OF THEIR LUSTER.
似乎已经迷失了
他们的一些光彩。

10:25.926 --> 10:29.362
SEA CREATURES, ATTACK!
海洋生物，攻击！

10:29.396 --> 10:30.430
PINCH ME.
捏我。

10:30.463 --> 10:31.765
I MUST BE DREAMING.
我一定是在做梦。

10:31.799 --> 10:36.236
( all mumbling and chattering )
（全是咕哝和喋喋不休）

10:36.269 --> 10:39.106
MISSION ACCOMPLISHED,
PATRICK.
使命完成，
帕特里克。

10:39.139 --> 10:41.041
YEAH, WE DID IT.
是的，我们做到了。

10:43.410 --> 10:44.878
I DID IT.
我做到了。

10:44.912 --> 10:47.014
I FEEL FIVE YEARS YOUNGER.
我感觉自己年轻了五岁。

10:47.047 --> 10:50.283
OH, IT'S GOOD
TO BE BACK.
哦，很好
回来了。

10:50.317 --> 10:51.284
WE DID IT,
YOU OLD COOT.
我们做到了，
你这个老傻瓜。

10:51.318 --> 10:54.187
WHO ARE YOU?
你是谁？

10:56.323 --> 11:00.393
The new adventures of
Mermaidman and Barnacleboy.
新的冒险
美人鱼和藤壶男孩。

11:00.427 --> 11:04.031
We join our heroes
in a battle of wits.
我们加入我们的英雄行列
斗智斗勇中。

11:14.474 --> 11:19.479
IT'S THE AQUA PHONE.
这就是 Aqua 手机。

11:19.512 --> 11:21.248
WHAT IS IT, CHIEF.
这是什么，酋长。

11:21.281 --> 11:25.685
HELLO, HELLO.
你好，你好。

11:26.987 --> 11:30.724
THAT PHONE IS STILL BROKEN.
那部手机还是坏了。

11:30.758 --> 11:32.392
REMIND ME TO GET THAT FIXED.
提醒我解决这个问题。

11:34.327 --> 11:37.097
REMIND YOU WHAT?
提醒您什么？

11:37.130 --> 11:38.498
REMIND ME OF WHAT?
提醒我什么？

11:38.531 --> 11:41.068
WILL OUR HEROES
EVER GET THEIR PHONE FIXED?
我们的英雄会吗
他们的手机修好了吗？

11:41.101 --> 11:43.871
Tune in next week and find out.
下周请收听并找出答案。

11:43.904 --> 11:47.074
WOW, THAT WAS EVEN BETTER
THAN THE OLD SHOW.
哇，那更好了
比老节目。

11:47.107 --> 11:48.909
IT'S ALL THANKS TO YOU!
这全都是你的功劳！

12:02.422 --> 12:05.158
WELCOME TO THE KRUSTY KRAB.
欢迎来到脆皮蟹。

12:05.192 --> 12:07.260
MY NAME IS SQUIDWARD.
我的名字是章鱼哥。

12:07.294 --> 12:08.328
CAN I TAKE YOUR ORDER?
我可以接受您的订单吗？

12:08.361 --> 12:12.532
HMM, OH, I'LL HAVE A...
嗯，哦，我要一个...

12:12.565 --> 12:15.268
NO.
不。

12:15.302 --> 12:17.170
OH, MAYBE...
哦，也许……

12:17.204 --> 12:18.405
NO.
不。

12:18.438 --> 12:19.873
HMM, I'LL HAVE...
嗯，我会...

12:19.907 --> 12:20.941
NO.
不。

12:20.974 --> 12:22.109
WELL MAYBE--
好吧，也许——

12:22.142 --> 12:23.911
ARE YOU PLANNING
ON ORDERING TODAY, SIR?
你有计划吗
先生，今天订购吗？

12:23.944 --> 12:26.046
I'LL HAVE A KRABBY PATTIE.
我要一份蟹肉饼。

12:26.079 --> 12:26.980
HOW ORIGINAL.
多么原始。

12:27.014 --> 12:28.248
AND WITH EXTRA ONIONS.
还有额外的洋葱。

12:28.281 --> 12:30.818
DARING TODAY, AREN'T WE.
今天我们很勇敢，不是吗？

12:30.851 --> 12:32.886
ONE KRABBY PATTIE,
EXTRA ONIONS.
一份蟹肉饼，
额外的洋葱。

12:32.920 --> 12:37.190
ONE CRYING JOHNNY COMING UP.
一个哭泣的约翰尼出现了。

12:37.224 --> 12:39.026
FIRST BUN, THEN PATTIE,
FOLLOWED BY KETCHUP, MUSTARD
第一个面包，然后是馅饼，
接下来是番茄酱、芥末

12:39.059 --> 12:42.129
PICKLES, EXTRA ONIONS, LETTUCE,
CHEESE, TOMATOES AND BUN
泡菜、额外的洋葱、生菜、
奶酪、西红柿和小圆面包

12:42.162 --> 12:44.264
IN THAT ORDER.
按照这个顺序。

12:44.297 --> 12:46.366
ONE CRYING JOHNNY UP!
约翰尼哭了！

12:46.399 --> 12:47.300
WHATEVER.
任何。

12:48.568 --> 12:52.205
12 KRABBY PATTIES ON WHEAT BUNS.
12 个蟹肉饼放在小麦面包上。

12:52.239 --> 12:57.277
( Spongebob repeating quickly: )
BUN, KRABBY PATTIE, BUN.
（海绵宝宝快速重复：）
包子，蟹肉饼，包子。

12:57.310 --> 13:01.114
ONE DOZEN CRYING COWS
ON THE FARM.
一打哭泣的牛
在农场。

13:01.148 --> 13:02.115
UP!
向上！

13:02.149 --> 13:03.316
THANKS, FARMER BROWN.
谢谢，农夫布朗。

13:03.350 --> 13:06.119
IT'S BEEN A THRILL SERVING YOU.
为您服务真是令人兴奋。

13:06.153 --> 13:07.254
CAN I GET SOME EXTRA SALT?
我可以加点盐吗？

13:07.287 --> 13:09.089
WE'RE ALL OUT.
我们都出去了。

13:09.122 --> 13:10.858
COULD YOU CHECK?
你能检查一下吗？

13:10.891 --> 13:12.926
NO.
不。

13:15.128 --> 13:16.529
LET ME GUESS, TINY
让我猜猜，小

13:16.563 --> 13:17.998
A SMALL SALAD?
小份沙拉？

13:18.031 --> 13:20.433
I TAKE A DOUBLE TRIPLE BARFY
DELUXE ON A RAFT.
我喝了两次三重酒
豪华木筏。

13:20.467 --> 13:22.535
FOUR-BY-FOUR,
ANIMAL STYLE.
四乘四，
动物风格。

13:22.569 --> 13:24.571
EXTRA SHINGLES
WITH A SHIMMY
AND A SQUEEZE.
额外的带状疱疹
摇摆
还有挤压。

13:24.604 --> 13:27.140
LIGHT AXLE GREASE, MAKE IT CRY.
轻轴润滑脂，让它哭泣。

13:27.174 --> 13:28.976
BURN IT AND LET IT SWIM.
烧掉它并让它游泳。

13:29.009 --> 13:31.478
WE SERVE FOOD HERE.
我们在这里提供食物。

13:31.511 --> 13:33.346
I GOT IT ALREADY, SQUIDWARD.
我已经明白了，章鱼哥。

13:33.380 --> 13:35.482
( gasping: )
BUBBLE BATH.
（喘气：）
泡泡浴。

13:36.884 --> 13:39.152
SQUAREPANTS.
方裤。

13:41.488 --> 13:45.959
I HEAR TALK
YOU MAKE A MEAN
KRABBY PATTIE.
我听到有人说话
你很卑鄙
蟹蟹派蒂。

13:45.993 --> 13:47.360
YEP!
是的！

13:47.394 --> 13:50.530
I HEAR TALK
YOU'RE KIND OF PICKY.
我听到有人说话
你有点挑剔。

13:50.563 --> 13:52.099
YEP!
是的！

13:52.132 --> 13:55.235
WELL, THEN,
HERE YOU GO!
那么，
给你！

13:55.268 --> 14:01.108
( stomping )
（跺脚）

14:01.141 --> 14:03.576
( sniffing )
（嗅）

14:07.647 --> 14:09.649
MMM.
嗯。

14:09.682 --> 14:13.553
WELL, BUBBLE BATH,
WHAT DO YOU THINK?
嗯，泡泡浴，
你觉得怎么样？

14:13.586 --> 14:16.656
THIS IS PRETTY GOOD.
这非常好。

14:16.689 --> 14:18.291
ONLY ONE THING--
只有一件事——

14:18.325 --> 14:21.461
YOU FORGOT THE PICKLES!
你忘了泡菜！

14:21.494 --> 14:23.596
( all gasping )
（全都气喘吁吁）

14:23.630 --> 14:24.331
NO!
不！

14:24.364 --> 14:27.067
THE BEST THERE IS?
最好的有吗？

14:27.100 --> 14:28.969
I DON'T THINK SO.
我不这么认为。

14:29.002 --> 14:33.240
YOU LOSE.
你输了。

14:33.273 --> 14:37.044
BUT THE PICKLES SHOULD BE
RIGHT WHERE THEY ALWAYS ARE.
但泡菜应该是
就在他们一直在的地方。

14:37.077 --> 14:38.946
I KNOW I PUT THEM ON.
我知道我穿上了它们。

14:38.979 --> 14:40.280
WHERE ARE THOSE PICKLES?
那些泡菜在哪里？

14:40.313 --> 14:41.214
PICKLES, PICKLES, PICKLES.
泡菜，泡菜，泡菜。

14:42.415 --> 14:44.051
AH!
啊！

14:44.084 --> 14:46.453
I BELIEVE
YOU OWE ME TWO BUCKS.
我相信
你欠我两块钱。

14:46.486 --> 14:48.088
TWO BUCKS!
两块钱！

14:48.121 --> 14:49.990
YOUR GUARANTEE.
您的保证。

14:55.495 --> 14:59.166
OH, THAT, WELL,
CAN WE TALK ABOUT THIS?
哦，那个，嗯，
我们可以谈谈这个吗？

14:59.199 --> 15:00.333
NO.
不。

15:00.367 --> 15:01.434
HOW ABOUT A DISCOUNT
ON RESTROOM TOKENS?
折扣怎么样
使用卫生间代币？

15:01.468 --> 15:02.469
FREE.
自由的。

15:02.502 --> 15:05.238
HOW ABOUT A FREE
GLASS OF WATER?
免费的怎么样
一杯水？

15:05.272 --> 15:06.273
A DOZEN FREE GLASSES OF WATER!
一打免费的水！

15:06.306 --> 15:07.607
I'LL EVEN PUT ICE IN IT.
我什至会在里面放冰。

15:07.640 --> 15:09.242
NO, COME BACK.
不，回来吧。

15:09.276 --> 15:10.677
TWO DOLLARS, TWO DOLLARS.
两美元，两美元。

15:10.710 --> 15:12.345
NO, NO.
不，不。

15:12.379 --> 15:16.283
MR. KRABS, I KNOW
I PUT PICKLES ON
THAT KRABBY PATTIE.
先生。螃蟹，我知道
我放了泡菜
那个蟹肉饼。

15:16.316 --> 15:19.086
THAT TWO BUCKS
IS COMING OUT OF YOUR PAYCHECK.
那两块钱
即将从您的薪水中扣除。

15:19.119 --> 15:20.020
WAIT.
等待。

15:20.053 --> 15:20.687
WAIT!
等待！

15:20.720 --> 15:23.156
GET BACK TO WORK.
回去工作吧。

15:23.190 --> 15:24.091
WE GOT ORDERS WAITING.
我们有订单在等待。

15:24.124 --> 15:25.692
I NEED A KRABBY PATTIE.
我需要一块蟹肉饼。

15:25.725 --> 15:30.030
OKAY, I AM NOT GOING
TO BLOW IT THIS TIME.
好吧，我不去
这次要搞砸了。

15:30.063 --> 15:31.431
LET'S SEE.
让我们来看看。

15:31.464 --> 15:35.202
BUN DOWN, THEN KETCHUP,
THEN MUSTARD, THEN PICKLES--
包子下来，然后番茄酱，
然后是芥末，然后是泡菜——

15:35.235 --> 15:37.971
NO, THAT'S NOT RIGHT!
不，那是不对的！

15:38.005 --> 15:42.642
BUN DOWN, MUSTARD, THEN KETCHUP,
LETTUCE, THEN THE PICKLES--
小圆面包，芥末，然后番茄酱，
生菜，然后是泡菜——

15:42.675 --> 15:44.144
NO.
不。

15:44.177 --> 15:48.448
MUSTARD DOWN, BUN, OH,
WHERE DOES THE PATTIE GO.
芥末酱，小面包，哦，
馅饼去哪儿了？

15:48.481 --> 15:49.416
PICKLES, KETCHUP
泡菜、番茄酱

15:49.449 --> 15:52.219
THINK, THINK,
I'M LOSING IT.
想，想，
我失去了它。

15:52.252 --> 15:58.158
BUN DOWN, SHOE,
MUSTARD, PAN, OH, NO.
发髻向下，鞋子，
芥末，平底锅，哦，不。

15:58.191 --> 16:00.627
MR. KRABS, I AM SO CONFUSED.
先生。蟹蟹，我很困惑。

16:00.660 --> 16:02.595
I CAN'T REMEMBER
HOW TO DO ANYTHING.
我不记得了
如何做任何事情。

16:02.629 --> 16:04.564
WHY DON'T YOU TAKE
THE REST OF THE DAY OFF.
你为什么不采取
这天剩下的时间休息。

16:04.597 --> 16:06.699
OH, NO, MR. KRABS.
哦，不，先生。螃蟹。

16:06.733 --> 16:08.068
WHO WILL MAKE
THE KRABBY PATTIES?
谁将制造
蟹肉饼？

16:08.101 --> 16:10.170
OH, DON'T WORRY ABOUT THAT.
哦，别担心。

16:10.203 --> 16:10.670
WE GOT SQUIDWARD.
我们得到了章鱼哥。

16:10.703 --> 16:11.438
HUH?
嗯？

16:11.471 --> 16:13.506
MR. KRABS IS RIGHT.
先生。蟹蟹是对的。

16:13.540 --> 16:16.009
I NEED TO GET MY HEAD STRAIGHT.
我需要保持清醒。

16:16.043 --> 16:17.110
NOW IS IT BUN, PATTIE, KETCHUP.
现在是小圆面包、馅饼、番茄酱。

16:17.144 --> 16:18.078
AH!
啊！

16:18.111 --> 16:21.014
THE DOOR, THE DOOR.
门，门。

16:21.048 --> 16:23.683
MR. KRABS,
THE FRONT DOOR IS MISSING!
先生。螃蟹，
前门不见了！

16:25.718 --> 16:29.756
OH.
哦。

16:29.789 --> 16:31.391
HA, HA, SORRY ABOUT THAT.
哈哈，抱歉。

16:31.424 --> 16:34.394
THIS PICKLE THING HAS GOT MY
HEAD ALL MESSED UP.
这个泡菜的东西已经得到了我的
头都乱了。

16:34.427 --> 16:38.165
I BETTER GET ON HOME
AND REST MY BRAIN.
我最好回家了
让我的大脑休息一下。

16:38.198 --> 16:40.233
WHICH WAY DO I LIVE?
我应该怎样生活？

16:40.267 --> 16:41.768
OF COURSE.
当然。

16:41.801 --> 16:43.570
HA! HA!
哈！哈！

16:44.804 --> 16:47.274
NO, NO, WAS IT
BUN, PATTIE, BUN?
不，不，是这样吗
发髻，帕蒂，发髻？

16:47.307 --> 16:48.675
TOMATO, PICKLE, BUN?
西红柿、泡菜、面包？

16:48.708 --> 16:49.542
NO.
不。

16:49.576 --> 16:50.443
BUN, NO.
发髻，NO。

16:50.477 --> 16:52.179
NO SHOE.
没有鞋子。

16:52.212 --> 16:54.647
OH, I AM SO CONFUSED.
哦，我很困惑。

16:54.681 --> 16:58.651
MAYBE A GOOD NIGHT'S SLEEP WILL
HELP ME GET MY HEAD ON STRAIGHT.
也许睡个好觉就会
帮助我把头摆正。

17:00.820 --> 17:04.724
OH, WAS IT MATTRESS, MATTRESS,
SHEETS, PILLOW, THEN SPONGEBOB.
哦，是床垫吗？床垫吗？
床单、枕头，然后是海绵宝宝。

17:04.757 --> 17:07.227
OH, THINK SPONGE.
哦，想想海绵。

17:07.260 --> 17:10.663
OH, YEAH, IT WAS MATTRESS,
SPONGEBOB, MATTRESS
哦，是的，这是床垫，
海绵宝宝、床垫

17:10.697 --> 17:12.199
THEN SHEETS, PILLOW.
然后是床单、枕头。

17:12.232 --> 17:12.732
GOODNIGHT, GARY.
晚安，加里。

17:12.765 --> 17:14.234
MEOW.
喵。

17:14.267 --> 17:17.137
NO, THIS ISN'T RIGHT.
不，这是不对的。

17:17.170 --> 17:18.105
GOODNIGHT, GARY.
晚安，加里。

17:18.138 --> 17:19.406
MEOW.
喵。

17:19.439 --> 17:22.375
WAIT, THIS ISN'T RIGHT, EITHER.
等等，这也不对。

17:22.409 --> 17:23.443
NOPE.
没有。

17:23.476 --> 17:25.178
NEGATIVE.
消极的。

17:25.212 --> 17:26.813
COME ON, COME ON, GET IT RIGHT.
来吧，来吧，做对了。

17:26.846 --> 17:28.448
WRONG, WRONG.
错了，错了。

17:28.481 --> 17:29.816
WRONG!
错误的！

17:29.849 --> 17:31.084
NOPE.
没有。

17:31.118 --> 17:31.818
NAW!
不！

17:31.851 --> 17:32.719
NEGATORY.
否定。

17:33.620 --> 17:35.322
( rooster crowing )
（公鸡打鸣）

17:35.355 --> 17:37.690
( horn blowing )
（喇叭吹）

17:37.724 --> 17:39.592
OH, I ALMOST HAD IT.
哦，我快要了。

17:39.626 --> 17:42.362
( horn continues to blow )
（喇叭继续吹）

17:42.395 --> 17:44.431
COME ON, CLOCK.
来吧，时钟。

17:44.464 --> 17:46.133
HOW DO I TURN THIS THING OFF?
我该如何关闭这个东西？

17:46.166 --> 17:48.801
THINK! THINK! THINK!
思考！思考！思考！

17:48.835 --> 17:49.836
MEOW.
喵。

17:49.869 --> 17:51.471
GARY.
加里。

17:51.504 --> 17:56.376
( horn continues )
（喇叭继续）

17:59.179 --> 18:00.447
( choking )
（窒息）

18:00.480 --> 18:02.382
( bell rings )
（铃声响起）

18:02.415 --> 18:04.417
PATTIES ARE DONE.
肉饼完成了。

18:08.388 --> 18:09.456
HEY, HE BURNT
MY KRABBY PATTIE.
嘿，他烧伤了
我的蟹肉饼。

18:09.489 --> 18:11.791
HE BURNT BY FRIES.
他被薯条烫伤了。

18:11.824 --> 18:12.792
( slurping )
（吸食）

18:12.825 --> 18:13.793
HE BURNT MY SHAKE.
他烧焦了我的奶昔。

18:13.826 --> 18:19.366
( muttering angrily )
（愤怒地嘟囔）

18:19.399 --> 18:20.567
NO, COME BACK.
不，回来吧。

18:20.600 --> 18:21.568
NO, NO.
不，不。

18:21.601 --> 18:25.472
I GOT TO GET SPONGEBOB BACK.
我必须把海绵宝宝找回来。

18:31.311 --> 18:31.778
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

18:38.451 --> 18:39.552
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

18:41.321 --> 18:42.522
MR. KRABS, HELLO.
先生。蟹蟹，你好。

18:42.555 --> 18:43.656
DO YOU HOW DO?
你怎么样？

18:43.690 --> 18:46.226
WHY ARE YOU
TALKING FUNNY, MAN?
你为什么
说话有趣吗，伙计？

18:46.259 --> 18:50.230
I ANYTHING CAN'T DO RIGHT
SINCE BECAUSE PICKLES.
我什么都做不好
因为泡菜。

18:50.263 --> 18:51.664
NONSENSE.
废话。

18:51.698 --> 18:53.433
YOU'LL BE BACK
MAKING KRABBY PATTIES
你会回来的
制作蟹肉饼

18:53.466 --> 18:54.767
LIKE YOUR OLD SELF IN NO TIME.
立刻就像以前的自己一样。

18:54.801 --> 18:56.369
I THINK DON'T
READY BACK
我认为不
准备回来

18:56.403 --> 18:58.238
TO GO TO WORK,
MR. KRABS.
去上班，
先生。螃蟹。

18:58.271 --> 19:00.740
WELL, YOU'RE FINE,
ME BOY.
嗯，你很好，
我男孩。

19:00.773 --> 19:02.509
( crash )
（ 碰撞 ）

19:02.542 --> 19:05.245
OOH, WELL, MAYBE NOT.
哦，好吧，也许不是。

19:05.278 --> 19:07.714
ALL WE NEED TO DO
IS GET YOUR CONFIDENCE BACK
我们需要做的就是
是让你重拾信心

19:07.747 --> 19:10.317
SO YOU CAN MAKE ME MORE MONEY.
这样你就能让我赚更多的钱。

19:10.350 --> 19:12.352
I MEAN, PATTIES.
我是说，肉饼。

19:12.385 --> 19:13.786
I HOW DO THAT?
我怎么办？

19:13.820 --> 19:15.422
IT'S LIKE
RIDING A BIKE.
就像
骑自行车。

19:15.455 --> 19:18.225
YOU NEVER FORGET.
您永远不会忘记。

19:18.258 --> 19:21.561
UH, I'M GOING
TO HELP YOU.
呃，我要去
为您提供帮助。

19:22.929 --> 19:24.931
YOU LEARN TO MAKE YOUR
KRABBY PATTIE AGAIN
你学会让你的
蟹肉饼再次出现

19:24.964 --> 19:26.733
YOU'LL LIFE
WILL BE BACK IN ORDER.
你会生活
将会恢复秩序。

19:29.369 --> 19:30.703
MR. KRABS, I DON'T KNOW...
先生。蟹蟹，我不知道……

19:30.737 --> 19:31.771
TAKE YOUR TIME.
慢慢来。

19:50.390 --> 19:51.924
NO, NO, NO, NO.
不，不，不，不。

19:51.958 --> 19:52.792
HMM...
唔...

19:58.531 --> 20:01.901
( snoring )
（打鼾）

20:01.934 --> 20:02.802
I GOT IT.
我得到了它。

20:02.835 --> 20:04.003
I GOT IT!
我得到了它！

20:04.036 --> 20:05.405
IT'S ALL VERY CLEAR
TO ME NOW, MR. KRABS.
一切都很清楚
现在对我来说，先生。螃蟹。

20:05.438 --> 20:06.739
IT IS?
这是？

20:06.773 --> 20:10.610
YES, I FINALLY REALIZE
THAT I CAN'T DO IT.
是的，我终于意识到
我做不到。

20:10.643 --> 20:12.279
I CAN'T DO IT, MR. KRABS.
我做不到，先生。螃蟹。

20:12.312 --> 20:13.313
I'M A FAILURE.
我是个失败者。

20:13.346 --> 20:14.547
DON'T TALK LIKE THAT!
别这样说话！

20:14.581 --> 20:17.984
DON'T YOU GET IS,
YOU CRUSTACEOUS CHEAPSKATE--
你不明白的是，
你这个顽皮的小气鬼——

20:18.017 --> 20:20.453
I CAN'T MAKE A DOUBLE CRABBY
PATTIE WITH THE WORKS.
我做不到双蟹
帕蒂与作品。

20:20.487 --> 20:24.257
I CAN'T PUT A PATTIE ON A BUN
WITH LETTUCE, CHEESE, ONIONS
我不能在面包上放馅饼
配生菜、奶酪、洋葱

20:24.291 --> 20:26.593
TOMATOES, KETCHUP, MUSTARD,
PICKLES, AND TOP BUN
西红柿、番茄酱、芥末、
泡菜和小面包

20:26.626 --> 20:28.395
TOGETHER IN THAT ORDER!
按照这个顺序一起！

20:31.063 --> 20:31.964
IT'S TIME.
是时候了。

20:44.577 --> 20:47.714
HEY, SPONGEBOB'S BACK.
嘿，海绵宝宝回来了。

20:47.747 --> 20:51.484
All:
SPONGEBOB!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

20:56.656 --> 20:59.892
I HEAR SQUAREPANTS IS BACK.
我听说方裤又回来了。

21:01.694 --> 21:03.663
I'M RIGHT HERE, BUBBLE BATH.
我就在这里，泡泡浴。

21:03.696 --> 21:08.601
I THOUGHT I RAN YOU OUT OF TOWN.
我以为我把你赶出了城。

21:08.635 --> 21:10.637
THIS IS WHERE I BELONG.
这就是我的归属。

21:12.872 --> 21:14.941
( growls )
（咆哮）

21:14.974 --> 21:16.509
RIGHT.
正确的。

21:16.543 --> 21:17.877
( gasps )
（喘气）

21:29.889 --> 21:32.024
GIVE ME THE REGULAR.
给我常规的。

21:32.058 --> 21:36.463
AND THIS TIME,
DON'T FORGET THE PICKLES.
而这一次，
不要忘记泡菜。

21:36.496 --> 21:37.497
I DIDN'T.
我没有。

21:44.604 --> 21:45.972
MMM...
嗯……

21:49.809 --> 21:52.712
STILL NO PICKLES!
仍然没有泡菜！

21:54.414 --> 21:55.715
SEE.
看。

21:56.383 --> 21:58.551
All:
YUCK.
全部：
恶心。

21:58.585 --> 22:02.655
YOU FAILED AGAIN,
SPONGEBOB-LOSER-PANTS.
你又失败了，
海绵宝宝失败者裤子。

22:02.689 --> 22:06.493
( diabolical laugh )
（恶魔般的笑声）

22:06.526 --> 22:08.395
WAIT A MINUTE.
等一下。

22:11.531 --> 22:12.599
LOOK.
看。

22:12.632 --> 22:13.733
HE'S BEEN HIDING
THE PICKLES
他一直在躲藏
泡菜

22:13.766 --> 22:15.067
UNDER HIS TONGUE
THE WHOLE TIME.
在他的舌头下
一直以来。

22:15.101 --> 22:17.770
AND THERE'S THE PICKLE
FROM LAST TIME, TOO.
还有泡菜
也是从上次开始。

22:17.804 --> 22:19.372
AND THERE'S MY CAR KEYS.
这是我的车钥匙。

22:19.406 --> 22:22.041
AND THERE'S MY RIDE.
这是我的旅程。

22:25.945 --> 22:31.418
THREE CHEERS FOR THE RETURN
OF OUR MR. FRY COOK, SPONGEBOB.
为回归欢呼三声
我们的先生。炒菜做饭，海绵宝宝。

22:31.451 --> 22:32.985
HIP-HIP--
臀-臀--

22:33.019 --> 22:33.853
All:
HOORAY!
全部：
万岁！

22:33.886 --> 22:34.554
HIP-HIP--
臀-臀--

22:34.587 --> 22:36.923
All:
HOORAY!
全部：
万岁！

22:36.956 --> 22:38.991
AND THREE CHEERS
FOR THE FRY COOK
欢呼三声
对于油炸厨师

22:39.025 --> 22:41.394
WHO TOOK MY PLACE
WHILE I WAS GONE--
谁取代了我的位置
当我离开时——

22:41.428 --> 22:43.129
SQUIDWARD.
章鱼哥。

22:43.162 --> 22:44.564
HIP-HIP.
臀臀。

22:44.597 --> 22:45.398
( unenthusiastic response )
（反应不热情）

22:45.432 --> 22:46.899
HIP-HIP.
臀臀。

22:46.933 --> 22:47.800
( unenthusiastic response )
（反应不热情）

22:47.834 --> 22:49.402
HIP-HIP.
臀臀。

22:49.436 --> 22:51.070
BOO!
嘘！

22:51.103 --> 22:52.905
YOU STINK!
你太臭了！

你太臭了！